{"title":"Career Roadmap · Musician","role":"Musician","summary":"A Musician is a professional who performs, creates, arranges, records or interprets music using the voice or a musical instrument.","facts":{"Current degree":"BPA (Bachelor of Performing Arts)","Course":"Vocal / Instrumental Music"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Musician is a professional who performs, creates, arranges, records or interprets music using the voice or a musical instrument."},{"type":"p","text":"A BPA graduate can build a career across live performance, studio recording, film and media, independent music, bands, orchestras, music education and digital music."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical career directions include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vocalist"},{"text":"Instrumentalist"},{"text":"Session musician"},{"text":"Live performer"},{"text":"Recording artist"},{"text":"Band musician"},{"text":"Orchestra musician"},{"text":"Accompanist"},{"text":"Studio musician"},{"text":"Composer"},{"text":"Music arranger"},{"text":"Songwriter"},{"text":"Music producer"},{"text":"Music educator"},{"text":"Independent artist"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Unlike conventional employment-based careers, musicians often build income through multiple professional streams rather than relying on one employer."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12 / Equivalent","BPA – Performing Arts / Music","Vocal / Instrumental Specialization","Technical & Repertoire Development","College Performances + Competitions","Live Shows + Recording Projects","Session / Freelance / Independent Work","Professional Musician","Senior Performer / Recording Artist","Composer / Arranger / Producer / Music Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"A realistic early-career progression can be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BPA Music","Music Intern / Performer","Session Musician / Band Member","Professional Musi